<title>SRI LANKA: CTC EAGLE SAYS APPOINTS NEW DIRECTOR.</title>
<headline>CTC EAGLE SAYS APPOINTS NEW DIRECTOR.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's CTC Eagle Insurance Co Ltd said in a statement on Thursday that it had appointed finance director Marina Tharmaratnam to the company's board.</p>
<p>The statement said the company's board of directors now had four executive and five non-executive members.</p>
</text>
